{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54154","headline":"奉和大德思天台次韵 · 李达","name":"奉和大德思天台次韵","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"金地炉峰秀气浓，近离双涧忆青松。\n劚泉拄锡净心相，远传佛教观真容。\n（见日本三井唐院藏真迹本，转录自傅云龙《游历日本图经》）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李达","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_54154.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54154","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}